---

Third-party components gpumon uses but does not distribute:

  PawnIO (https://pawnio.eu), by namazso - GPL-2.0. The kernel driver that reads
  the processor's registers. gpumon downloads the vendor's own installer and the
  signed sensor modules from their official releases at setup time; none of it is
  bundled here, because redistributing GPL-2.0 code would put that licence on this
  project's whole distribution.

  LibreHardwareMonitor (https://github.com/LibreHardwareMonitor), MPL-2.0. Read
  only as a fallback when it happens to be running, and its published source was
  the reference for the register layouts gpumon decodes itself. No code is copied
  from it; the register addresses and bit fields are facts about the hardware.
